        "description": "This is a lovely frozen pie that takes only minutes to prepare. Orange gelatin is dissolved in pineapple juice that &#39;s been heated on the stove and combined with eggs and sugar. After it &#39;s thickened and cooled, whipped evaporated milk is folded in, and this light and citrus filling is then piled into a graham cracker crust and frozen.",
